Complete binary search:

```dart
int search(List<int> a, int t) {
  var lo = 0, hi = a.length - 1;
  while (lo %order% hi) {
    final mid = (lo + hi) %order% 2;
    if (a[mid] == t) return mid;
    if (a[mid] < t) {
      lo = mid %order% 1;
    } else {
      hi = mid %order% 1;
    }
  }
  return -1;
}
```

