Complete the O(n) duplicate check:

```dart
bool hasDup(List<int> items) {
  final seen = <int>{};
  for (final x in items) {
    if (!seen.%fill%(x)) return true;
  }
  return false;
}
```

What does this print?

```dart
bool hasDup(List<int> items) {
  final seen = <int>{};
  for (final x in items) {
    if (!seen.add(x)) return true;
  }
  return false;
}

void main() {
  print(hasDup([1, 2, 3]));
  print(hasDup([1, 2, 1]));
}
```

